{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">汇丰：智谱AI年化与AI及近期数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">智谱（Z.ai）在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年7月实现年化经常性收入（ARR）<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10亿美元</span>，比公司此前指引的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>底提前约5个月。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">HSBC</span>随即调整其ARR预测——<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>底从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10亿</span>升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20亿美元</span>，2027年底从24亿升至65亿美元。但与此同时，这一调整背后，是收入结构向低毛利API倾斜、竞争加剧导致定价承压、以及7月完成310亿港元H股增发后股本扩张三重因素共同作用的结果。报告认为智谱有望在2027年实现盈利，而非此前预期的2028年。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWXl3DvoE2w0026NGdUQIhvXbEVAvsy6mIrib0qHoToZtj3pvO3iakEtVbp7p6DLQ9zgPzvetq3JKlkeMFKZ42HXsCKoWJEJ5Lw4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXyOWncf4Wn2QggwOFuR4CUiaa8ESSJ0WlTdIAwYUnvGgr9Kl7MqMJItCK1eEiae8Dq9XehQ7TzvaUSib2fpdWgMaRQQnUFib0ExOY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXM4gXYJWa8rtLDubYROQeeObIbGKQ5zYj2v0iboH6zibCkRjWz2vaYKTH8gkQoeLicMLUzINmvJoDcTsJls5r7BV7311X4UtOTic4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXAvq7qyJpHRK00ia6pmkEMKppxdbzHq0PIwG6E5ycqwOdsnn0Ieal62joPI6Mo5TOPT0Yaxko96Lic80aWtlh7glVVrqrg5ynFo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 38-HSBC-Z.AI-2513.HK-报告观点- Lifting ARR- implications from Kimi K3-260728</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
